{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"虚痨 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"全治法：论治痨病 论虚痨 论治痨虫","date_published":"2026-04-24T14:25:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-04-24T14:29:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/1-12-quanzhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/1-12-quanzhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["痨病","虚痨","痨虫"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“全治法”部分，专论痨瘵（痨病、虚劳）的全面调治法则。核心思想是：痨病乃阴虚阳亢之证，忌用温补霸药，宜通身清补，平调五脏；若已成痨虫，则须补虚与杀虫并行。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“全治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e痨瘵（痨病、虚劳）\u003cstrong\u003e的全面调治法则。核心思想是：痨病乃阴虚阳亢之证，忌用温补霸药，宜\u003c/strong\u003e通身清补，平调五脏\u003c/strong\u003e；若已成痨虫，则须\u003cstrong\u003e补虚与杀虫并行\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}